    "_status": "DRAFT, proposed for the registration, not frozen, not run",
    "_rationale": {
      "rtol_atol": "rtol 1e-8, atol 1e-10. At rtol 1e-6 the classifier's fixed-point bound (final derivative 1e-6) sat on the solver's noise floor and split converged fixed points in two; at 1e-8 they fall 10x inside it (results/audit/classifier_calibration.json vs classifier_calibration_rtol1e-8.json). Adopted after review 3.",
      "t_max_t_tail": "doubled from legacy with the tail kept at the final third, because lower Hill coefficients may settle more slowly; tail_range and final_derivative will show whether this suffices",
      "attempts": "RK45 first; a larger RK45 budget only if the first hit its cap; an implicit stiff method only after a failure of any kind (2026-09-21 code review). Radau versus BDF to be chosen by benchmark before the freeze."
    },
